+    /*
+     * The sticky element itself is a *named* scroll-state container, so the
+     * stuck-state query below only ever targets these section headers and
+     * never the sticky site <nav>. The document/viewport is the scroll root;
+     * headers stick directly beneath the fixed-height nav.
